window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Anca was born to hunt, but not all monsters are beasts.</p> <p></p> <p>The Hunting Households are failing. Her people are starving. And the callous Queen Astasia reigns in luxury.</p> <p></p> <p>Anca’s only chance to usurp the cycle of tyranny arrives with an unthinkable task: hunt a rampaging beast alongside Eugen, a feared former hunter. She discovers that Eugen despises the queen and the hunters, like Anca, who exiled him. Yet as the hunt falters, their mutual hate turns to desire.</p> <p></p> <p>But Eugen has more secrets than Anca can imagine. With their prey close, and the fate of their land in the balance, she must choose between what duty demands and what her heart craves.</p>"; 
